                                                "sense_id": "7224723f-1ed2-3550-b4dc-c475577ca595",
                                                "text": "[…]there cam a womã with an alablaſter boxe of oyntment / called narde / that was pure and coſtly / and ſhe brake the boxe ãd powred it on his heed."
                                            },
                                            {
